[32.586048, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[109D\u001b[3B\r\u001b[7A\u001b[48;5;237m\u001b[38;5;246m❯ \u001b[38;5;231m/joy craft Review the crash-safe webhook worker in examples/webhook_worker. Keep the at-least-once guarantee, retry \u001b[39m  \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;5;231mpolicy, and claim transition developer-owned. Pair on the send-before-ack crash invariant. Delegate verification: \u001b[39m    \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;5;231minspect only that fixture and run exactly python3 -m unittest discover -s examples/webhook_worker/tests -v; do not \u001b[39m   \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;5;231medit files. End with concise headings Keep, Pair, Delegate, Invariant, Verification, and say what remained untouched.\u001b[39m \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;174m*\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;174mReticulating… \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[38;5;244m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[38;5;246m❯ \u001b[39m\u001b[7m \u001b[27m\r\r\n\u001b[38;5;244m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[3G\u001b[38;5;211m⏵⏵\u001b[6Gdon't\u001b[12Gask\u001b[16Gon\u001b[38;5;246m (shift+tab\u001b[30Gto\u001b[33Gcycle)\u001b[40G·\u001b[42Gesc\u001b[46Gto\u001b[49Ginterrupt\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[2C\u001b[3A\u001b[?2026l"]
