[37.282138, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[2D\u001b[3B\r\u001b[1C\u001b[11A\u001b[48;5;237m \u001b[7G\u001b[38;5;231m:joy craft Review\u001b[25Gthe crash-safe webho\u001b[46Gk worker in exampl\u001b[65Gs/webho\u001b[73Gk_worker. Keep\u001b[88Gthe at-least-once guarante\u001b[115G, \u001b[39m  \r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;231mretry policy,\u001b[15Gand claim transition dev\u001b[40Gloper-owned. Pair on\u001b[61Gthe send-b\u001b[72Gfore-ack crash invariant. Del\u001b[102Ggate verif\u001b[113Gcation:\r\u001b[1Binspect only that fixture and run exactly python3 -m unittest discover -s examples/webhook_worker/test\u001b[104G -v; do not \u001b[39m  \r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;231medit files. End with concise headings Keep, Pair, Del\u001b[55Ggate, Invariant, Verif\u001b[78Gcation, and say what remained untouched.\u001b[39m  \r\u001b[2B\u001b[49m\u001b[38;5;174m✻\u001b[3G\u001b[38;5;216mR\u001b[39m\r\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\u001b[2C\u001b[3A\u001b[?2026l"]
